# ScholarLink

> Discover opportunities made for you.

ScholarLink is an Android application that helps students discover scholarships, government schemes, internships, fellowships, grants, and educational opportunities through personalized eligibility matching.

## Why I Built This

As a student, I realized that many students miss valuable opportunities simply because they never hear about them or don't know whether they're eligible.

ScholarLink aims to make discovering opportunities simple, personalized, and accessible.

## Features

- Personalized onboarding questionnaire
- Eligibility-based opportunity matching
- Scholarships, internships and government schemes
- Search and filtering
- Save opportunities
- AI-assisted recommendations

